{"id":"1c0cb75d224ec787","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-card7-tower-number.md","title":"ZFC Card7 Tower Number","display":"df-zfc-card7-tower-number — ZFC Card7 Tower Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-card7-tower-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-card7-tower-number"],"display":"df-zfc-card7-tower-number — ZFC Card7 Tower Number","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cardinality]]","[[58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-card7-tower-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-card7-tower-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-card7-tower-number — ZFC Card7 Tower Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"58-df-cardinality\">58-df-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04bd0d627c2b2877\" href=\"?note=04bd0d627c2b2877\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness\">58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S\\)</span> (tower-witness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"04bd0d627c2b2877\" href=\"?note=04bd0d627c2b2877\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness\">58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard7TowerNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard7TowerNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}tower\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard7TowerNumber}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\exists\\mathcal T\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal T)\\land |\\mathcal T|=\\kappa)\\land \\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa)\\to\\neg\\exists\\mathcal U\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal U)\\land |\\mathcal U|=\\lambda)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}tower\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard7TowerNumber}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\exists\\mathcal T\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal T)\\land |\\mathcal T|=\\kappa)\\land \\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda&lt;\\kappa)\\to\\neg\\exists\\mathcal U\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal U)\\land |\\mathcal U|=\\lambda)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The last conjunct now minimizes over smaller cardinals explicitly and uses a distinct witness variable, so the scope does not conflate the witnessing tower at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> with a hypothetical smaller tower.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness","status":"resolved","id":"04bd0d627c2b2877","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness","status":"resolved","id":"04bd0d627c2b2877","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S$ (tower-witness predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-ci-tower-number-witness]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard7TowerNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}card7\\text{-}tower\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCard7TowerNumber}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\exists\\mathcal T\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal T)\\land |\\mathcal T|=\\kappa)\\land \\forall\\lambda\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\lambda<\\kappa)\\to\\neg\\exists\\mathcal U\\;(\\mathrm{ZfcCiTowerNumberWitness}_S(\\mathcal U)\\land |\\mathcal U|=\\lambda)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":1511,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1516","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-card7-tower-number.md|58-df-zfc-card7-tower-number]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","2be08d4ee8aa1590","04bd0d627c2b2877"]}